ite-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69d0211be4f6dcd663691c98_illustrate-img.webp" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 280px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69d0211be4f6dcd663691c98_illustrate-img-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69d0211be4f6dcd663691c98_illustrate-img.webp 560w" class="presentation-image"/><div class="w-layout-vflex presentation-item-content"><h3 class="heading-small-test text-weight-semibold">Illustrate</h3><p class="paragraph-18pts text-color-dark-grey p-height-140">Create figures from our vast library of scientifically accurate and vetted images.</p></div></div><div class="presentation-item"><img width="280" loading="lazy" alt="User avatar with chat icon, buttons labeled Share and Export, and a dropdown menu showing options: Present, Copy to PowerPoint, Invite and share with a notification of 3, Add to community, and Send a copy." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69d0211b2470dc06da40180f_collaborate-img.webp" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 280px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69d0211b2470dc06da40180f_collaborate-img-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69d0211b2470dc06da40180f_collaborate-img.webp 560w" class="presentation-image"/><div class="w-layout-vflex presentation-item-content"><h3 class="heading-small-test text-weight-semibold">Collaborate</h3><p class="paragraph-18pts text-color-dark-grey p-height-140">Organize, edit, and review figures together in one shared workspace.</p></div></div><div class="presentation-item"><img width="280" loading="lazy" alt="Diagram illustrating protein overexpression and purification from bacteria in six steps: transformation with plasmid, selection on agar plate, protein production in flask, cell lysis, protein purification, analysis of purification by dialysis and activity assay." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69d6c8008cf73d37b6d26a17_present-img.webp" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 280px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69d6c8008cf73d37b6d26a17_present-img-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69d6c8008cf73d37b6d26a17_present-img.webp 560w" class="presentation-image"/><div class="w-layout-vflex presentation-item-content"><h3 class="heading-small-test text-weight-semibold">Present</h3><p class="paragraph-18pts text-color-dark-grey p-height-140">Submit and publish clear and concise visuals in grants, journals, filings, and more.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-feature pad-top-bot-s bg-very-light-yellow"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer content w-container"><div class="w-layout-hflex as-seen-wr"><div class="as-seen-content"><div class="as-seen-text">MCP Integrations</div><div class="as-seen-logos"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69ab3e4dfd2e16573f55257b_anthropic-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Anthropic logo" class="as-seen-logo sm"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69ab3e53c89e4b79538df1e8_open-ai-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="OpenAI logo" class="as-seen-logo lg"/></div></div><div class="as-seen-divider"></div><div class="as-seen-content"><div class="as-seen-text">As seen in</div><div class="as-seen-logos"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69a8d6502687163eca544cbe_bloomberg-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Bloomberg logo" class="as-seen-logo"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69a8d6505a4a42930aac5b9d_inc-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Inc. logo" class="as-seen-logo xmd"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f1effebfe03881da9bd/69e29b8668fb9cfd8a667d80_fast-company-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Fast Company logo" class="as-seen-logo md"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621e6f